st or don't perform a non-movement action.\nAlchemists use specially prepared gems as ammunition to throw bombs, which must be reloaded manually.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#弹药剩余#LAST#\n表示你剩余的弹药数量。\n弓和投石索在弹药耗尽的时候必须装填，当你休息或移动的时候会自动装填。\n炼金术士使用特殊的炼金宝石来作为弹药使用，必须手动装填。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"098268dd1b69e17e2f6c3857a1299fb12b70f7547536188679583f5755cd78df","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7d74a16beefdcae13b9a7e43ce0e9bc5fba7ccb2de6349853494d73994e1c8e4","logical_entry_identity":"816a2f916c378c9fe27e30279006a64e0583ec58bfb28295821b858f3424caa4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Pushy elf","source_tag":"entity name","target":"爱出风头的精灵"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9c7cf36f237d636d5b94437c2bbd6035895297b1ccf266792ee8f14a1744f0bf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7d7635025dc042204d0cbbdbe62fff36aff6342292b86ae1db678f02d1c0431c","logical_entry_identity":"f99b818513b13c3a65f323c6e85bbc9a16b8dbe29ee5f059de7ddb174524ac84","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"As you deal the last blow you quickly carve out Celia's heart for your Lichform ritual.\nCarefully weaving magic around it to keep it beating.","source_tag":"_t","target":"当你挥出最后一击后，你迅速挖出赛利亚的心脏，为巫妖仪式做准备。小心的用魔法环绕它来保持它的跳动。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e7f78a543d823bd4f22ee63a308dbdad4aa304c33e40d6be9aef450aa699761b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7d861a6071ccf5f3db28312c32ca9058865ee6b243c2491242bf43e5dd144367","logical_entry_identity":"9a9b53f07ef59426783f29641aa9db0ba12c3e66b19277643d39329e0829e804","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Summon a storm of swirling blades to slice your foes, inflicting %d physical damage and bleeding to anyone who approaches for %d turns.\n\t\tThe damage and duration will increase with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"召唤旋转剑刃风暴将敌人切成碎片，对进入风暴的敌人造成 %d 点物理伤害并令其流血 %d 回合。\n\t\t伤害和流血持续时间受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2eaf7cb0ff4db553302c55f132b12bba4792bcaf7e69fe80f4a4d959